        "original_id": "1f264604-f078-5bb1-91ce-4dab7d406515",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Manganiello, Flash Thompson, Peter Parker, Spider-Man, Alec Baldwin, Salma Hayek, Bridget Moynahan, Natalia Cigliuti, Jim Gaffigan, Ben Platt\n- Works: Spider-Man trilogy, ER, How I Met Your Mother, One Tree Hill, True Blood, Drunk Parents\n- Roles: Flash Thompson, Alcide Herveaux\n- Topics: television roles, film cast, character relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Joe Manganiello played Flash Thompson in Sam Raimi's Spider-Man trilogy.\n- Joe Manganiello had recurring television roles on ER, How I Met Your Mother, and One Tree Hill before his breakout role.\n- Joe Manganiello's breakout role was the werewolf Alcide Herveaux on the HBO television series True Blood.\n- Flash Thompson is a star high school football player who mercilessly bullies his classmate Peter Parker.\n- Flash Thompson greatly admires Spider-Man, creating an irony because Spider-Man takes some gratification from that admiration.\n- Flash Thompson and Peter Parker become close friends in college.\n- The film Drunk Parents stars Alec Baldwin, Salma Hayek, Bridget Moynahan, Joe Manganiello, Natalia Cigliuti, Jim Gaffigan, and Ben Platt.",
